          "heading": "Tom Pearson back training as England quartet eye Saints return",
          "body": "Northampton's Tom Pearson is back training with the full squad, and Phil Dowson says \"it won't be long before he's back out there\", though there is no confirmation he will be ready for Saturday's match against Leicester. The bigger boost for England is that Manny Iyogun, Alex Coles, Henry Pollock and Tommy Freeman, rested for the Champions Cup win over Cardiff, are all expected back this weekend. Dowson also has a hard call at scrum-half between Alex Mitchell and Archie McParland."
