          "kicker": "Injury blow",
          "heading": "Thomas Ramos to miss France's entire autumn Nations Championship with thigh injury",
          "body": "France lose their main goal kicker for the autumn. Thomas Ramos will miss all four Nations Championship matches after aggravating a thigh injury first picked up in September, according to L'Equipe, and France have chosen to rest him rather than risk a longer problem. The fullback, Six Nations top scorer four years running, is also a loss against a backdrop of injuries to Matthieu Jalibert, Emmanuel Meafou and Julien Marchand. Galthié is expected to name his 42-man squad on Wednesday."
        },
