        {
          "kicker": "Selection call",
          "heading": "Farrell to name Ireland squad today with Caelan Doris still sidelined",
          "body": "Andy Farrell names his Ireland squad for the second Nations Championship window on Wednesday, and captain Caelan Doris is still sidelined, though some welcome returnees are expected. Ireland are fourth in the Northern Hemisphere table behind France, Scotland and England, and Farrell is expected to demand a notable uplift in accuracy and energy after the error-strewn July defeat by New Zealand in Auckland. Argentina, Fiji and South Africa come next."
