          "heading": "Italy lost 32-14 to South Africa at home in November 2025",
          "body": "Italy's most recent meeting with South Africa was a 32-14 defeat at home in November 2025, in the International Friendlies. This is a single result, not a head-to-head record. The next fixture brings the sides together again in Round 4 of the Nations Championship, with Italy on no wins from three matches, having scored 37 points and conceded 131 in that span."
