      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "World Cup hopes",
          "heading": "Tandy won't rule out Faletau from World Cup despite November squad omission",
          "body": "Steve Tandy has not ruled out Taulupe Faletau for the 2027 World Cup, even though the 35-year-old was left out of the November squad. Faletau, who has 109 Wales caps and has not played under Tandy, only returned from injury in Cardiff's Champions Cup defeat by Northampton on Sunday. Tandy said \"we would definitely not rule anyone out\", but has made clear the decision depends on Faletau putting together consistent rugby first."
        },
