          "heading": "Argentina-led four-nation bid for 2035 World Cup awaits World Rugby decision",
          "body": "Argentina lead a joint bid with Uruguay, Chile and Brazil to host the 2035 Rugby World Cup, and the bid stays open until World Rugby selects the host. Reuters reported the submission on 6 October, and Planet Rugby frames the bid as a challenge to the governing body's reported desire for a European return. The host is still to be chosen, so the Pumas' hosting case remains unresolved."
