          "kicker": "Sevens title",
          "heading": "Japan's women's sevens defend ARESS title; Greening's men beat Hong Kong China",
          "body": "Japan's women's sevens side finished the Asia Rugby Emirates Sevens Series with an undefeated campaign in Colombo, beating China 14-7 in the final to take the series with the maximum 40 points. The men also won the Leg 2 final, 28-14 over Series winners Hong Kong China, a rare defeat for the Hong Kong side. Phil Greening, Japan men's sevens head coach, said the win was valuable because it 'demonstrates the team's ability to adapt to different situations.'"
        },
